{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_013exd6NmskjpKY2qFqxoAPQ", "type": "tool_result", "content": "{\"result\":\"### mcp:orders/get_order\\n\\nFetch one order record: order_id, region, amount, status.\\n\\n**Call**: `await orders_get_order(order_id=<string>)`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n- `order_id` (string, required)\\n\\n**Returns**\\n- `value` (object)\\n\\n### mcp:orders/list_order_ids\\n\\nList every order id in the store.\\n\\n**Call**: `await orders_list_order_ids()`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n*(no parameters)*\\n\\n**Returns**\\n- `result` (string[], required)\"}"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "8adcc48b-8d48-49f8-8cd8-c57877fddde9", "uuid": "c825937c-dc70-4e3d-b52f-230400c368a6", "timestamp": "2026-07-09T21:08:20.186Z", "tool_use_result": {"content": "{\"result\":\"### mcp:orders/get_order\\n\\nFetch one order record: order_id, region, amount, status.\\n\\n**Call**: `await orders_get_order(order_id=<string>)`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n- `order_id` (string, required)\\n\\n**Returns**\\n- `value` (object)\\n\\n### mcp:orders/list_order_ids\\n\\nList every order id in the store.\\n\\n**Call**: `await orders_list_order_ids()`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n*(no parameters)*\\n\\n**Returns**\\n- `result` (string[], required)\"}", "_meta": {"fastmcp": {"wrap_result": true}}, "structuredContent": {"result": "### mcp:orders/get_order\n\nFetch one order record: order_id, region, amount, status.\n\n**Call**: `await orders_get_order(order_id=<string>)`\n\n**Parameters**\n- `order_id` (string, required)\n\n**Returns**\n- `value` (object)\n\n### mcp:orders/list_order_ids\n\nList every order id in the store.\n\n**Call**: `await orders_list_order_ids()`\n\n**Parameters**\n*(no parameters)*\n\n**Returns**\n- `result` (string[], required)"}}}
